{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_007_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fa631d1125f2f1d3e13aef2fe0df8c84b91a8fa366afeb4ddece347ac4730dbf",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79c38b1460daa8c97fbfb88f411a1879e627d4e808f1d311d77d97bfde3cea56",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，辛苦了。\n给，这个。请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:941232742e149775959294fe137315705395d61fabb368051d150a3a62693b90",
      "text": "情人节时送了我那么棒的巧克力，\n谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a2987a589a305c9c69bb0d35f919f5a3b4f71c8aca009b68f60b880b514615a",
      "text": "这是那时的谢礼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d34f56135ab1a6bd0a44cd2b785e69fedfbd26156837e606b09b49434f85d5f",
      "text": "虽然不知道是不是会让你喜欢的东西，\n但要是能合你的心意就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:617459d8aead43e08108e4660919c3331ed1e761c5c965916f04736ff3925e09",
      "text": "不嫌弃的话，等会儿静下心来再拆开看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27e6dc3c3013e3e27c25c4610d35114a557ee4dd26bc60599af3ca89dffb9722",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー，\n是你叫醒了我吧，谢谢你……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9d3618aff1e4d7624393c11df4a6d22c158450bc7c3a379aa20329520e7d1c7",
      "text": "呼哇……其实我一直都在\n等你回来呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:910be474ea052ec9d46f4de2e93dc41a810a1d19c47ebe354428e54bf6b8ddb2",
      "text": "想把这个交给你呢。\n呵呵，这是白色情人节的回礼哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:185ec8962d000980e3d4d3723862566a78d99ef4193a040e800437e9caf679c3",
      "text": "我是照着感觉会让你开心的东西\n试着挑选的，不知道怎么样呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000041:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6c2283ef9e33353468a916863a91ec4e3e2e1f057d1b9843fe9f015def8957ec",
      "text": "非常感谢。我真的很高兴！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000042:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:819a806835b1af1e2adb6c76d1f550fcf3cca4ead31dfd54481095bd5cbfd763",
      "text": "没想到居然能收到……非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:63ca6ab192d778f248c3df9a8561afc9ad366d293a0510d46257fbf1824b0092",
      "text": "呵呵，你能喜欢真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6072f1c7aa85f6dc766d34d44756441496163098e682db529a91df645d158834",
      "text": "从●●●●プロデューサー那里收到的\n巧克力，很好吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c11e3078912b0062c2e904e89661c3bf0272e37f8eaf18b7caa33204dc849fd4",
      "text": "之后有阵子我都完全没吃别的东西就度过了呢。\n真不可思议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20ae28e43c614519bcccedc8a925b0e3ecdf4afed9076470bcc7c771de609610",
      "text": "大概是因为里面饱含着\n制作人的心意吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_007_22:5_02_007_22_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5891b96d677578b33f6f530c0385f24eb1abc51318079329c7591c8422edae91",
      "text": "如果通过这份回礼，哪怕能向你回报那份心意的\n一点点就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
